OrangeIslands_Kinnow_BattleBoat_Arena_Text_Offer::
	.string "Thirty-two rounds, and we lend\n"
	.string "you the POKEMON.\p"
	.string "Six are brought up, you keep\n"
	.string "three. Beat a team and you may\l"
	.string "take one of them, up to six; once\l"
	.string "you are full it becomes a trade.\p"
	.string "Every fourth round is a GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER of HOENN. Six of their own,\l"
	.string "all one type. {STR_VAR_2} is first.\p"
	.string "We pay by depth, and you may stop\n"
	.string "between rounds. Sit down?$"

